 "title": "刷卡写字楼",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 102.82,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.376,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.126
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "许可链，只让获得授权的参与者，读写或出块。",
   "spoken": "许可链，只让获得授权的参与者，读写或出块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.196,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 4.294,
   "speechEnd": 8.306
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "由多家组织共同治理的许可链，叫联盟链。",
   "spoken": "由多家组织共同治理的许可链，叫联盟链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.36,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 9.458,
   "speechEnd": 12.767
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "它把谁能参与，从密码学和经济的问题，变成了身份和治理的问题。",
   "spoken": "它把谁能参与，从密码学和经济的问题，变成了身份和治理的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.828,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "speechStart": 13.926,
   "speechEnd": 18.83
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "攻击者不再需要多数算力。",
   "spoken": "攻击者不再需要多数算力。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.904,
   "dur": 2.76,
   "speechStart": 20.002,
   "speechEnd": 21.823
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "一张有效证书，一把管理员密钥，或者几家成员共谋，就够了。",
   "spoken": "一张有效证书，一把管理员密钥，或者几家成员共谋，就够了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 22.884,
   "dur": 5.952,
   "speechStart": 22.982,
   "speechEnd": 28.005
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "打个比方，公链像公共广场，谁都能进，靠规则和押金维持秩序。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，公链像公共广场，谁都能进，靠规则和押金维持秩序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.056,
   "dur": 6.504,
   "speechStart": 29.154,
   "speechEnd": 34.713
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "许可链像一栋写字楼，进门要刷工牌。",
   "spoken": "许可链像一栋写字楼，进门要刷工牌。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 35.78,
   "dur": 3.936,
   "speechStart": 35.878,
   "speechEnd": 38.878
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "陌生人大多进不来，可发工牌的前台，拿着万能钥匙的物业，成了最值得攻击的人。",
   "spoken": "陌生人大多进不来，可发工牌的前台，拿着万能钥匙的物业，成了最值得攻击的人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.936,
   "dur": 7.152,
   "speechStart": 40.034,
   "speechEnd": 46.248
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 47.308,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 47.406,
   "speechEnd": 49.191
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "写字楼失窃，可以调监控，可以报警。",
   "spoken": "写字楼失窃，可以掉监控，可以报警。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 50.24,
   "dur": 3.792,
   "speechStart": 50.338,
   "speechEnd": 53.207
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "联盟链里，多数成员可以合法地重写业务状态。",
   "spoken": "联盟链里，多数成员可以合法的虫写业务状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 54.252,
   "dur": 4.608,
   "speechStart": 54.35,
   "speechEnd": 58.016
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "账本本身，看不出这是作恶。",
   "spoken": "账本本身，看不出这是作恶。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 59.08,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 59.178,
   "speechEnd": 61.57
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "按攻击者控制的资源，排一排入口。",
   "spoken": "按攻击者控制的资源，排一排入口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 62.636,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 62.734,
   "speechEnd": 65.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "一张普通成员证书，能读通道数据，发送畸形请求。",
   "spoken": "一张普通成员证书，能读通道数据，发送畸形请求。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 66.432,
   "dur": 5.496,
   "speechStart": 66.53,
   "speechEnd": 71.089
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "组织管理员的证书，能改本组织的配置，批准链码。",
   "spoken": "组织管理员的证书，能改本组织的配置，批准链码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 72.148,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 72.246,
   "speechEnd": 76.234
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "根 CA 的私钥，能签发任意身份。",
   "spoken": "根 CA 的私钥，能签发任意身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 77.288,
   "dur": 3.504,
   "speechStart": 77.386,
   "speechEnd": 79.957
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "足够多的背书组织，能写入符合策略的任意状态。",
   "spoken": "足够多的背书组织，能写入符合策略的任意状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 81.012,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 81.11,
   "speechEnd": 84.872
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "所以不要把成员都是持牌机构，当成安全假设。",
   "spoken": "所以不要把成员都是持牌机构，荡成安全假设。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 85.936,
   "dur": 4.848,
   "speechStart": 86.034,
   "speechEnd": 89.95
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "Ronin 桥有 9 个验证者，5 个签名就能放行，攻击者控制了验证者，提走了资金。",
   "spoken": "Ronin 桥有 9 个验证者，5 个签名就能放行，攻击者控制了验证者，提走了资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 91.004,
   "dur": 7.032,
   "speechStart": 91.102,
   "speechEnd": 97.197
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "许可的集合小，攻破的门槛也低。",
   "spoken": "许可的集合小，攻破的门槛也低。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 98.256,
